  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dynamic Trees</a>&nbsp;| <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terralith\" rel=\"nofollow\">Terralith</a></h2>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/975/393/terralith.png\" alt=\"header\" width=\"1176\" height=\"480\"></h5>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/A4FCBS3\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0Prkr13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"166\" height=\"32\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>概述</strong></h2>\n<p>此模组使 Terralith 与 Dynamic Trees 兼容，在世界生成过程中为其生物群系添加了动态生长的树木。<br>通过 Tree Packs（树木包），可以自定义和调整这些树木、它们的行为以及它们的生成方式。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong>功能</strong></strong></h2>\n<h4><strong>世界生成&nbsp;</strong></h4>\n<p>所有 Terralith 生物群系都会生成自定义树木，数量众多，无法一一列举！以下是一些生物群系现在外观的示例：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/937/676/screenshot_2023-08-07_195732.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"687\" height=\"361\"></p>\n<p>盾山 (Shield)</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/937/678/image.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"687\" height=\"358\"></p>\n<p>樱花林 (Sakura grove)</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/937/680/image.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"687\" height=\"396\"></p>\n<p>紫晶雨林 (Amethyst Rainforest)</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/937/682/image.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"687\" height=\"375\"></p>\n<p>冬季和秋季天空之境 (Winter and Autumn Skylands)</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/937/688/image.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"883\" height=\"458\"></p>\n<p>高山高原 (Alpine Highlands)</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/937/691/image.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"883\" height=\"465\"></p>\n<p>森林高原 (Forested Highlands)</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>还有更多更多！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong>其他附加组件</strong></strong></h2>\n<p>其他模组的 Dynamic Trees 附加组件可在<a href=\"https://github.com/DynamicTreesTeam/DynamicTrees/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\"> Dynamic Trees 维基</a>中找到。</p>\n<h4><strong>建议与请求：</strong></h4>\n<p>如需请求添加对新模组的兼容性支持，请在此处提交！！<br><a href=\"https://github.com/orgs/DynamicTreesTeam/discussions/categories/compatibility-addon-suggestions\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/orgs/DynamicTreesTeam/discussions/categories/compatibility-addon-suggestions</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong>依赖要求</strong></strong></h2>\n<p>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Dynamic Trees<br></a>-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terralith\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Terralith</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>许可与整合包</strong></h2>\n<p>您可以将此模组用于任何您喜欢的整合包中！无需征得同意。<br>本模组采用<strong>MIT</strong>许可证，其源代码在 GitHub 上公开。</p>",
